{"sha": "9fe0119306ff0188e98d81ae18e0065456d1848767aaf3f5657ef84e17240a16", "body": ["\\chapter{向量}\\label{ch:g10:vectors}", "", "向量刻画一个位移：它有方向和长度，与起点无关。", "向量能给出几何事实的简洁证明，一旦引入坐标，", "这些问题便化为简单的计算。它们将在", "\\cref{ch:g10:lines}中成为关键工具，之后还将在", "\\cref{ch:g11:scal}中用于数量积。", "", "\\section{平移与向量}", "", "\\begin{definition}[向量]\\label{def:g10:vectors:vector}", "给定两点 $A$、$B$，\\emph{向量}\\index{向量} $\\vect{AB}$", "表示从 $A$ 到 $B$ 的位移，它具有", "\\emph{方向}（直线 $(AB)$ 的方向，连同", "沿直线从 $A$ 指向 $B$ 的走向）和", "\\emph{长度}（距离 $AB$，也记作 $\\norm{\\vect{AB}}$）。", "两个向量当它们表示相同的位移时\\emph{相等}：", "$\\vect{AB} = \\vect{CD}$ 表示，对任一点施加两个位移，", "所得结果相同。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[相等向量与平行四边形]\\label{prop:g10:vectors:parallelogram}", "$\\vect{AB} = \\vect{CD}$ 当且仅当 $ABDC$（顺序不可颠倒！）为", "平行四边形（可以是退化的） --- 等价地，$[AD]$ 与", "$[BC]$ 有相同的中点。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (2.2,0.8);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (1.0,-1.2);", "  \\coordinate (D) at (3.2,-0.4);", "  \\draw[omExo, thin] (A) -- (C);", "  \\draw[omExo, thin] (B) -- (D);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (A) -- (B)", "    node[midway, above, font=\\small] {$\\vect{AB}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (C) -- (D)", "    node[midway, below, font=\\small] {$\\vect{CD}$};", "  \\fill (A) circle (1.5pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (1.5pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\fill (D) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$D$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 相等向量 $\\vect{AB} = \\vect{CD}$：方向相同，指向相同，", "长度相同。四边形 $ABDC$ 是平行四边形。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{notation}", "当端点无关紧要时，向量常用单个字母表示，", "例如 $\\vec u$ 或 $\\vec v$。\\emph{零向量} $\\vec 0 = \\vect{AA}$ 是", "什么也不移动的位移。\\emph{相反向量}指", "与 $\\vect{AB}$ 长度相同、方向相反的向量 $\\vect{BA}$，", "记作 $\\vect{BA} = -\\vect{AB}$。", "\\end{notation}", "", "\\section{向量的加法}", "", "\\begin{definition}[两个向量的和]\\label{def:g10:vectors:sum}", "\\emph{和}\\index{向量!和} $\\vec u + \\vec v$ 是先作 $\\vec u$、", "再作 $\\vec v$ 所得的位移。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[夏勒关系]\\label{thm:g10:vectors:chasles}", "对任意三点 $A$、$B$、$C$，有", "\\[", "\\vect{AB} + \\vect{BC} = \\vect{AC}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "从 $A$ 到 $B$，再从 $B$ 到 $C$ 的位移，把", "$A$ 移到 $C$，即 $\\vect{AC}$ 所表示的位移。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[平行四边形法则]", "要将从同一点出发的两个向量 $\\vect{AB} + \\vect{AC}$ 相加，", "补全平行四边形 $ABDC$：其和即为对角线 $\\vect{AD}$。", "事实上 $\\vect{AC} = \\vect{BD}$，故", "$\\vect{AB} + \\vect{AC} = \\vect{AB} + \\vect{BD} = \\vect{AD}$，由夏勒", "关系可得。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (2.4,0.5);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (3.4,2.0);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (A) -- (B)", "    node[midway, below, font=\\small] {$\\vec u$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (B) -- (C)", "    node[midway, right, font=\\small] {$\\vec v$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omMeth, thick] (A) -- (C)", "    node[midway, above left, font=\\small] {$\\vec u + \\vec v$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hspace{1.4cm}%", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (2.4,0.5);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (1.0,1.5);", "  \\coordinate (D) at (3.4,2.0);", "  \\draw[omExo, thin] (B) -- (D) -- (C);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (A) -- (B)", "    node[midway, below, font=\\small] {$\\vect{AB}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (A) -- (C)", "    node[midway, left, font=\\small] {$\\vect{AC}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omMeth, thick] (A) -- (D)", "    node[pos=0.75, below right, font=\\small] {$\\vect{AD}$};", "  \\fill (D) circle (1.2pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$D$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}